698 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Funky Frames isn\031t just about mirrors\054 it\031s about character\054 charm and fun\056 Born from the idea that d\351cor should be as lively as the people living with it\054 Funky Frames introduces mirrors with personality\056\240\nThis brand identity was designed to embody the energy\054 boldness\054 and quirks that make these mirrors stand out in any room\056\050\n\nPROJECT GOAL\072\nTo create a vibrant\054 playful\054 and memorable visual identity for a quirky mirror brand\056 Through bold colors\054 and unconventional shapes\054 Funky Frames aims to stand out in the home decor market by offering mirrors that not only reflect your style but also spark joy and creativity in any space\056\240\050)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 697 0 R
     /Pg 660 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

